          "quote": "[2023-03-09T11:03:30] John Williams: While we\u2019ll discuss pricing specifics in detail later in the Quote stage, I can assure you our offerings are designed to be cost-effective over time, ensuring favorable total ownership costs along with sustainable pricing models. Our aim is to pool cost efficiency with cutting-edge technologies.",
